WEBVTT

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.800
Why so suddenly?

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:11.740
Ren-chan.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.350
Finally, the two of us can live happily ever after.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:20.540
Hato... nee...

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.190
Hato-nee!

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:30.740
I'll make her work like a dog.

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:33.190
You...

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:34.290
I'm not going to forgive you!

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:36.800
You've got some attitude, kid.

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:42.180
What?!

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:47.020
However, attitude alone won't be enough to defeat me.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.610
At least put up a fight, servant.

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:56.160
Onee-chan.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.870
I will also fight at full might.

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:05.470
So you better give me everything you have.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.750
Don't be so reckless!

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:20.430
Ouch!

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:22.890
Huh? Hato-nee...

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:25.420
Hato-nee's hair?

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:29.610
That's right, we were able to work as live-ins.

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:30.770
Wake up!

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:33.150
Beniko!

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.320
What is all that noise?

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:39.070
Idiot, your morning greetings are incorrect!

00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:40.360
Huh?

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.290
Um... morning.

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:45.210
Morning.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:29.730
Good morning to a special day, everyone.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:35.020
From today, the Uesugi Mihato and Ren siblings
will start their probationary period.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:36.750
It's a pleasure.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.900
Wow, it looks good on you!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:41.950
I'm envious!

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:44.770
Out of everyone, you fit the image of a maid the most.

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:45.450
Huh?

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:48.500
My my, Ren-chan, you look so cool!

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.460
And you look beautiful, Hato-nee.

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:52.560
Is that so?

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:54.120
Kuruppo!

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.090
Thank you for the meal.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.720
Then, it's time for work.

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:02.500
Mihato, you and Benisu are in charge of catering needs.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:03.200
Yes.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.090
Er, and me?

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:09.310
You're on the assault squad, so make sure you back up
each section and learn everything on the job.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:12.630
In other words, you're to do miscellaneous chores. An excess.

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:13.780
What do you mean by that?

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:16.810
In any case, you're an unwanted child... huh?

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.220
Hatodekopin!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:21.950
What did you say to my beloved Ren-chan?

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:23.280
Yeah, yeah.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:29.080
Well, the only position we really need is Miyu-san's
personal attendant, so you better do a good job of it.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.580
Personal?

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:35.080
You've all blossomed beautifully.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.710
Oh, Ren-kun!

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.140
Are you going to lend me a hand?

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:39.840
If it's just things like removing weeds.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.420
That'll be helpful.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.550
I'll teach you how to tend to it.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:46.630
Natose-san, Ren-kun, you sure are pumped up.

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:47.910
Morning, Yume!

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:49.850
Good morning, Ojou-sama.

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:53.940
Morning and I'm on my way!

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:55.150
Have a good day.

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:56.560
Be careful.

00:04:57.010 --> 00:04:59.020
Yumecchi, your obentou!

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:01.070
That's my mistake!

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.950
Was that Natose-san?

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:07.000
Get out of the way!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:11.790
Please have a nice day at work.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:15.540
Knowing Shinra-sama, you can handle any job with ease.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:19.130
Ah, then I'll finish it right away for Beni's sake.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.790
Have a good day, Master.

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:26.930
Personal means that, huh.

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:34.010
Oh, let me help you with the cleaning.

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:35.930
Um.. was it, Haru?

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:44.420
Yes, you remembered it on the first try!

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:48.280
This is the most moving moment of Kiyohara Chiharu's life!

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:52.100
Come on, let's make a clean world together!

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:53.550
Y-Yeah...

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:56.320
Be extra careful when cleaning the corridors.

00:05:56.320 --> 00:06:00.960
Among the antiques there's a memento from the late Master.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:04.210
Stare.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:12.220
It's kind of unsettling.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:15.720
Um, Miyu-san, are you feeling any better?

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:18.460
Yes, I made you worry, didn't I?

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:21.730
The butler attire looks good on you.

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:24.940
I inadvertently feasted my eyes on you.

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:26.900
Feasted your eyes?

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:28.360
I'm just kidding.

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.610
You're working hard from the first day.

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:32.950
Thank you...

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:40.210
Um... is it okay for us to eat together?

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:45.710
Of course. The dining table is one of the most important spot for verbal communication.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:49.340
In the Kuonji household, servants are part of the family.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:50.280
Family...

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:53.600
Food tastes good when we're all here, right?

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:56.820
Beni-san, the red things... the red things...

00:06:56.820 --> 00:06:59.310
If you don't eat it, you won't grow!

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:00.990
Follow Natose's example.

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:03.440
Huh, what?

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:11.870
Colonel, tell us about your adventures.

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:17.520
Very well, then tonight I will tell you about the story
when I was stationed in the mercenary unit...

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:20.960
Where I became lost during a sandstorm.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:25.880
But, knowing you, Colonel,
I bet you completed the mission all by yourself.

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:20.680
That feels good, Beni.

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:23.180
Shinra-sama...

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:28.690
And guess what? Yume was chosen as the captain!

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:30.980
Huh, of the track team?

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:33.600
That's amazing, Yume.

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:44.720
I can't wait until summer, Ren.

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:48.000
For some reason, I have the chills.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.660
Did you catch a cold?

00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:54.970
It doesn't seem like you have a fever.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:59.720
Onee-chan's secret tool, a woolen haramaki!

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:01.560
As long as you have this...

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:06.480
My, my, Ren-chan.

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:11.620
You're still the same when you were little.

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:17.660
Miyu-san, don't you have to go to school?

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.510
I graduated a long time ago.

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:22.410
Oh, so you've finished your compulsory education.

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:24.450
I'm an university graduate, you know!

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:26.010
Huh?

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:28.200
Do I look younger than you?

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.150
Yes, I mean, no, not at all!

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:31.420
I mean...

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:38.420
Since I received this as a gift, shall we eat it together?

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:39.550
No, thank you.

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.260
Come on, don't say that.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:44.020
Once you top it with cream...

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:46.230
It looks more scrumptious.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:46.870
Come on.

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:49.380
Hey! I said I don't want it!

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:52.520
Oh, I'll wipe it right away.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:00.000
Onee-chan will clean it for you.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:05.040
Mmm, this is delicious.

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:08.620
T-This is humiliating. Right in front of a servant!

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.420
Just show it off to him.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:12.000
No, let go!

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.540
Come on, Miyu-tan.

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:21.140
Kuruppo!

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:24.450
I found the book which Miyu-chan
was searching for on the net.

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:25.850
Shall I order it for you?

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:27.730
Hato-nee!

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:27.730
M-Mihato!

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.520
You're pretty good.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:32.020
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:37.610
You saved me, Mihato.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:38.320
It's nothing.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:42.030
Nee-san has a habit of teasing things she likes.

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:44.380
You two should also be careful.

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:45.830
Y-Yes.

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:49.640
Today was another hard day.

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:50.460
Oh, Ren.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:57.840
Aha, is the sight of a pheromone emitting grown up
woman too much to handle for a boy like you?

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:00.700
N-No... it's not that...

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:02.750
You don't have to be bashful.

00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:05.010
Since we're inside the house.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:08.100
Under the relationship of master and servant.

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:11.310
U-Um... er... that is...

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:15.270
Since you're too innocent,
I'm worried about what lies ahead.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.130
Who's there?

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:28.450
Oh, it's you, Ren-kun.

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:33.460
Oh, so this connects to your room, Natose-san.

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:36.370
Yes, with this veranda.

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:37.780
Hmm.

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:40.170
Whoa, the nightscape is pretty!

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:42.650
Have you gotten used to the job?

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:46.500
A butler's work is harder than I imagined.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.930
More than that, the people here are too unique.

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:52.480
But since it's our job to provide pleasure,

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.150
aren't you happy?

00:11:55.990 --> 00:11:58.650
I wonder if I'm providing any pleasure.

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:01.390
Ren-kun, you'll be all right.

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:09.120
Can it be that you're the type who always wanted a little brother, Natose-san?

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:10.910
H-How did you know?

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:14.370
Well, I'm not being pampered by my sister for nothing.

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:18.920
Let's do a good job tomorrow, too!

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:21.250
Let's serve from the bottom of our hearts!

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:22.010
Yes!

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:37.360
In order for them to be pleased...

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:39.770
I must serve from the bottom of my heart...

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:43.940
I'm so beautiful, it's a sin.

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:02.260
We're on our way!

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:06.680
A hard working Ren-chan sure is lovely.

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:11.000
But it's a little sad.

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:16.010
Yikes, I might be late!

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:18.560
Huh?

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:21.550
Ow!

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:25.460
Oh, sorry. Are you hurt?

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:28.660
A-Are you hurt somewhere?

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:31.620
More... more...

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:32.990
M-More?

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:35.230
Ren-kun, are you all right?

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:35.960
Mii...

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:39.960
Huh? Is this person your friend?

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:45.970
Hi, I'm Anastasia Mistina.

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:49.470
H-How do you do.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.940
M? Don't tell me the M stands for...

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:54.450
Ah, your cold stare!

00:13:56.380 --> 00:13:57.520
It's piercing me!

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:00.730
I-I'm coming!

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:05.630
So this is Yume Ojou-sama's school, huh.

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:06.670
Hey!

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:08.500
Oh, Kei, morning.

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:11.240
This is our newcomer, Uesugi Ren-kun.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.580
I'm Inamura Keiko.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:16.160
All three of us are on the same track tream and in the same class.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:17.810
We're always together.

00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:19.260
All three of you?

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:22.590
Ah, that cold stare of yours again!

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:24.090
Nice to meet you.

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:27.760
B-Beef jerky?

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:28.970
U-Um...

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:33.520
Good for you, Natose-san!

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:36.100
Is that okay for her to be trained with a reinforcer like that?

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:38.350
Move, move, move, move, move!

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:43.110
T-That's right, I'm on duty today, see ya.

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:51.280
Everybody, morning.

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:53.250
What the?

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:55.530
Ageha-chan, morning.

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:56.780
Oh, Yume...

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:58.740
Ageha-sama!

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:00.940
You're late, Kojuurou!

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:02.000
I am deeply sorr...

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.760
You buffoon!

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:05.670
She hit him!

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:10.120
I am deeply sorry.

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:14.000
I was assisting an elderly woman at crossing the street.

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:16.480
You did a good deed!

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:17.350
This is your reward!

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:20.010
Heaven and hell!

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:21.270
Supreme bliss!

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:23.410
She even hits him as a reward.

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:25.610
It's your everyday physical contact, right?

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:30.290
Yes, Yume, my trusted friend.
Is this an underling of yours?

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:33.280
Yup, he's Uesugi Ren-kun.

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:36.010
I am Kuki Ageha.

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:39.540
The person that just flew by is Kojuurou, my steward.

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.540
Nice to meet you.

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:45.480
That aside, what do you excel at?

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:48.250
It certainly isn't martial arts. You have too many holes.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:52.080
I can't allow Yume Ojou-sama to be embarrassed.

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:53.460
I must...

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:55.450
E-Excuse me.

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:56.290
Huh?

00:15:57.550 --> 00:16:00.000
You have dirt on the edge of your right shoe.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.850
You must have gotten it while you were running.

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:06.060
Oh, you're quite attentive.

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:09.780
Since you are pretty, the stain stands out.

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:10.820
What?

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:12.650
Eat this konpeitou!

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:13.830
Huh?

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:17.250
Thankfully accept my alms.

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:19.460
So she says.

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:21.660
Good for you, Ren-kun!

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:25.570
This is tasty, you know.

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:29.010
You're right. Yummy!

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:31.250
You better be thankful!

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:33.670
It seems like you have your share of hardships.

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:36.000
Hardships? No way.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:39.430
I'm happy just to be serving Ageha-sama.

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.000
Do you like her?

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:46.270
W-W-W-W-W-Wrong... i-i-i-it's out of loyalty.

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:47.920
I got the message, so eat.

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:49.440
No, I'm going to pass.

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:53.490
To be handed things personally from Ageha-sama is the ultimate spice!

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:54.950
How much are you in love with her?

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:58.200
As I just said, loyalty and affection are two separate things.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:00.200
Right, my trusted friend, Ren?

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:03.150
Since when did I become your friend?

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:04.900
Aren't you glad to make more friends?

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:10.000
Ren-nii, just a little bit longer and you'll be officially hired.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:14.770
Kid, if you pass, I'll teach you the ways to become a special man.

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:17.760
Huh? I bet it's something like how to groom your mustache.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.010
It's almost bedtime for children.

00:17:22.010 --> 00:17:24.010
Onii, good night.

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:25.000
Good night.

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:29.990
Really, what a bunch of weirdos.

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:37.280
Morning!

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:40.260
Morning...

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:49.040
If you get carried away,
you're going to blunder at the end.

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:53.530
From tomorrow on, I'm going to be
a legitimate butler for the Kuonji family.

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:54.460
Hello.

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:57.240
As punishment for startling you...

00:17:58.270 --> 00:17:59.800
Please discipline me.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:01.870
U-Um...

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:03.550
Come on, hit me!

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:07.500
Mii, what are you doing loafing around here, you fool!

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.230
You saved me, Kei-san.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:11.870
Yo, Uesugi-don.

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:14.300
Did you happen to see a ferret around? A yellow one.

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:16.320
No, what happened?

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:20.470
A school board member's house is in the neighborhood,
where the wife let the ferret run away.

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:24.320
The club that finds it will have its budget increased,
so everyone's searching frantically.

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:25.910
It isn't here.

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:28.380
Where could it have gone?

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:29.330
Yume Ojou-sama.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:31.750
Captain, what to do next?

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:36.000
Oh, Yume's the captain, huh.

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:37.840
Get a hold of yourself!

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:44.480
So, all that's left is the porch.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:47.330
Huh? Was there a stuffed animal over there?

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:52.190
I guess it was there, or I guess it wasn't.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:55.000
Not only that, it's a ferret...

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:58.000
I found you!

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:01.100
For the sake of Yume Ojou-sama...

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:03.950
Don't take it personally.

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:05.800
Hold it right there!

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:11.460
I got you.

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:17.460
Hey, that hurts!

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:20.380
You stinking rat!

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:28.970
Shut up!

00:19:36.310 --> 00:19:38.460
I-I...

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:40.530
just...

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.530
I deeply apologize for this!

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:48.170
Don't blame Ren-kun. It was for Yume.

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:51.540
No, this was due to the kid's carelessness.

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:54.220
There isn't much we can do to to defend you.

00:19:54.220 --> 00:19:56.540
Tomorrow is the day when the decision will be handed out, right?

00:19:57.030 --> 00:19:57.990
Yes.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:03.300
This incident will be taken into consideration
when we pass down the verdict.

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:14.480
Am I... Am I...

00:20:21.310 --> 00:20:23.110
The same as him?

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:26.870
Am I only able to break things as well?

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:28.510
And hurt others?

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:30.370
Ren-kun.

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:36.020
Ren-kun, you'll be all right, for sure.

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:38.110
Don't console me, please.

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:40.490
Ren, clench your teeth.

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:45.180
That was my practice of tough love.

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:46.440
Miyu-san...

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:50.140
After that, Mihato pleaded on how good of a person you were.

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:51.590
Hato-nee?

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:56.140
That you're a strong minded person who would never run from something, no matter how excruciating it is.

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:59.990
I am going to continue my job as a butler!

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:06.400
He's so simple and cute.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:18.980
There's no way I'm going to give up until the very end.

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:24.130
I hereby hand out the decision.

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:31.640
First of all, Uesugi Mihato, you have passed with flying colors.

00:21:32.530 --> 00:21:34.230
Thank you very much!

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:35.920
You did it, Hato-nee!

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:37.870
As for you, Uesugi Ren.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:43.460
The act of destroying the Kuonji family pot is unforgivable.

00:21:45.340 --> 00:21:49.860
However, in light of your diligent work and comical character,
I shall overlook such wrongdoing.

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:52.370
Huh? That means...

00:21:52.780 --> 00:21:54.010
You have passed.

00:21:54.010 --> 00:21:55.120
That's what it is.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:56.590
Hooray!

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:57.940
I told you!

00:21:57.940 --> 00:22:00.000
Congratulations, Ren-nii!

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:02.630
Thank you very much!

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:05.200
Mihato will be Miyu Ojou-sama's personal attendant.

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:07.330
And the kid will continue to be on the assault sqaud.

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:10.840
When you have the time,
you can be the personal attendant of whoever you wish.

00:22:10.840 --> 00:22:11.810
Huh?

00:22:12.340 --> 00:22:15.800
I-I'm to choose?

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:20.350
I... I...

00:22:21.350 --> 00:22:24.340
Yes, the sight of you being perplexed makes my day.

00:22:24.340 --> 00:22:27.360
For now, I command you to be my personal attendant.

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:28.860
Huh?

00:22:35.210 --> 00:22:37.620
Just when I managed to pass...

00:22:38.140 --> 00:22:41.470
It looks like my ordeal is far from over.

00:24:10.340 --> 00:24:12.260
Shinra-sama is an amazing conductor, you know.

00:24:13.090 --> 00:24:15.260
I bet you can't appreciate music.

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:17.000
You fool. Just watch.

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:19.560
Violin, make it more clearer!

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.540
Cello, play the rhythm with more care.

00:24:21.540 --> 00:24:23.390
Who's this guy? Awesome!
